            "lineHeight": 1.4,
            "indent": 0,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Combine the logarithms into one product; the intermediate factors cancel.",
                "marks": []
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\ln\\left(\\frac21\\right)+\\ln\\left(\\frac32\\right)+\\cdots+\\ln\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right)&=\\ln\\left(\\frac21\\times\\frac32\\times\\cdots\\times\\frac{n+1}{n}\\right)\\\\\\ln\\left(\\frac21\\right)+\\ln\\left(\\frac32\\right)+\\cdots+\\ln\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right)&=\\ln\\left(\\frac{n+1}{1}\\right)\\\\\\ln\\left(\\frac21\\right)+\\ln\\left(\\frac32\\right)+\\cdots+\\ln\\left(1+\\frac1n\\right)&=\\ln(n+1).\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
